    <preface>
      <p>Migration Amendment (Tabling Notice of Certain Character Decisions) Act 2021</p>
      <p>No. 36, 2021</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Migration Act 1958</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
